# Rebel Coffee Orders: REST and MCP requests from "REST APIs for Beginners".
# Start the server first:  hapi serve orders --mcp
@base = http://localhost:3000

### REST: list every order
GET {{base}}/orders

### REST: filter by status (query parameter)
GET {{base}}/orders?status=pending

### REST: one order by ID (path parameter)
GET {{base}}/orders/A-1001

### REST: an order that does not exist -> 404
GET {{base}}/orders/A-9999

### REST: create an order (a write)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "item": "Lion Mug", "quantity": 1 }

### MCP: which tools does this server offer?
POST {{base}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "tools/list" }

### MCP: call the getOrder tool (same controller as GET /orders/{orderId})
POST {{base}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/call", "params": { "name": "getOrder", "arguments": { "orderId": "A-1001" } } }
